" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(31, 41, 55, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" textAlign="left"><p>N-masking is not biological perturbation.</p><p>No independent host, assay or measured-structure claim.</p></content></shape><shape width="864" height="30" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="474" presetHandlers="6" type="round-rect"><fill><fillColor color="rgba(219, 234, 254, 1)" /></fill><content fontSize="16" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(31, 41, 55, 1)" /></shape><shape width="836" height="21" topLeftX="62" topLeftY="478" type="text"><content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="9.8" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(37, 99, 235, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" textAlign="left" wrap="false"><p>SAME BODY · SAME LENGTH · TWO BACKGROUNDS PER COMPONENT</p></content></shape><shape width="780" height="13" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="512" type="text"><content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="8.2" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(100, 116, 139, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" textAlign="left" wrap="false"><p>Source: result 5eaddc34e9a6 · closeout b9473cf36ba3 · independent 155/155 · clean 187/187</p></content></shape><shape width="62" height="15" topLeftX="850" topLeftY="510" type="text"><content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="10" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(31, 41, 55, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" textAlign="right" wrap="false"><p>156</p></content></shape></data><note><content><p>The four windows differ only in the upstream four nucleotides and start ATG.</p><p>This design tests separability under the frozen predictive contract; it does not perturb biological RNA.</p><p>All reported values and evidence boundaries on this page come from the accepted RK34 source files.</p></content></note></slide>
